"Channels" = "通道";
"Choose which channels Flowlight watches" = "选择 Flowlight 监视哪些通道";
"Nothing but the network is being watched" = "当前只监视网络";
"Bluetooth and USB are off until you turn them on. Neither needs a permission Flowlight doesn't already have — they're off because watching them widens what the app looks at, and that should be your decision rather than something an update did.\n\nNeither can report bytes. macOS keeps no per-app accounting for these channels, so what Flowlight can honestly show is what is connected, which apps are built to use it, and when that changed." = "蓝牙和 USB 在你开启之前一直关闭。两者都不需要 Flowlight 尚未拥有的权限 —— 它们默认关闭，是因为监视它们会扩大这个应用的观察范围，而这应该由你决定，而不是由某次更新替你决定。\n\n两者都无法报告字节数。macOS 不为这些通道记录按应用的用量，所以 Flowlight 能诚实展示的，是有什么设备连接着、哪些应用本就是为使用它而做的，以及这些情况何时发生了变化。";
"No byte counts on these channels. macOS keeps no per-app accounting for Bluetooth or USB, so a figure here would be invented. What is honest is what's connected, which apps are built to use it, and when that changed." = "这些通道没有字节计数。macOS 不为蓝牙或 USB 记录按应用的用量，所以这里给出任何数字都只会是凭空编造的。诚实的做法是展示有什么连接着、哪些应用本就是为使用它而做的，以及这些情况何时发生了变化。";
"This is each app saying so in its own Info.plist — who asked for Bluetooth, not who macOS granted it to. That second list lives in a database an app can't read, and Flowlight would rather name the difference than blur it." = "这来自每个应用自己的 Info.plist —— 是谁申请了蓝牙，而不是 macOS 把它授权给了谁。后一份名单存放在应用无法读取的数据库里，Flowlight 宁愿把这个差别说清楚，也不愿把它含糊过去。";
"How Flowlight recognises this device between sightings" = "Flowlight 如何在多次出现之间识别这台设备";

